<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS4" title="In Appendix F Directional Convergence of the Nadaraya–Watson Estimator ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.4 </span>Proof of Lemma <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
