<p id="Thmconj215.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmconj215.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">There exists a multi-head self-attention <math id="Thmconj215.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mu}_{2}\in\mathcal{MA}(N,H,B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝛍</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mu}_{2}\in\mathcal{MA}(N,H,B)</annotation></semantics></math> such that</span></p>
