\mathbf{q}_{t}\end{matrix}\right)_{t\in[T]}\begin{array}[]{l}\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{1}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{2}}\\
\left.\right.\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{N/2}\end{array}\longmapsto\quad\left(\begin{matrix}\mathbf{x}_{1,t}\\
\mathbf{x}_{2,t}\\
\mathbf{x}_{1,t-r_{1}}\\
