\mathbf{q}_{t}\end{matrix}\right)_{t\in[T]}\begin{array}[]{l}\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{1}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{2}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{1}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{1}}\\
\vdots\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{1}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{2}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{2}}\\
