<p id="A5.SS3.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Using the definition of <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Z}_{1,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Z}_{1,t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Z}_{2,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Z}_{2,t}</annotation></semantics></math> in (<a href="#S5.E17" title="In 5 Proof Sketch of the Upper Bound for the Approximation Error ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>), the map <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mu}_{1,0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mu}_{1,0}</annotation></semantics></math> applied to <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> has the form</p>
<table id="A5.EGx123" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.EGx123.1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.EGx123.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bm{\mu}_{1,0}(M)=\left(\begin{matrix}\bm{\phi}_{1}(\mathbf{X}_{t})\\
\bm{\phi}_{2}(\mathbf{X}_{t})\\
\mathbf{Z}_{1,t}\\
\mathbf{Z}_{2,t}\\
\bm{0}_{\tfrac{N}{2}-(r_{1}+1)m_{1}-(r_{2}+1)m_{2}}\\
\mathbf{q}_{t}\end{matrix}\right)_{t\in[T]}=\left(\begin{matrix}\bm{\phi}_{1}(\mathbf{X}_{t})\\
\bm{\phi}_{2}(\mathbf{X}_{t})\\
\bm{\phi}_{1}(\mathbf{X}_{t-r_{1}})\\
\operatorname{stack}\big(\bm{\phi}_{1}(\mathbf{X}_{t-r_{1}+1}),\ldots,\bm{\phi}_{1}(\mathbf{X}_{t-1})\big)\\
\mathbf{Z}_{2,t}\\
\bm{0}_{\tfrac{N}{2}-(r_{1}+1)m_{1}-(r_{2}+1)m_{2}}\\
\mathbf{q}_{t}\end{matrix}\right)_{t\in[T]}\begin{array}[]{l}\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{1}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{2}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{1}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{(r_{1}-1)m_{1}}\\
\in\mathbb{R}^{r_{2}m_{2}}\\
\left.\right.\\
