<p id="A5.SS3.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Finally, we define the map <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mu}_{2,0}:\mathbb{R}^{N\times T}\rightarrow\mathbb{R}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mu}_{2,0}:\mathbb{R}^{N\times T}\rightarrow\mathbb{R}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
