<tbody id="A5.Ex337"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex337.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\Big(\max_{t\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\big\|\operatorname{stack}(\mathbf{x}_{3,t},\mathbf{x}_{4,t})-\operatorname{stack}(\mathbf{x}^{\prime}_{3,t},\mathbf{x}^{\prime}_{4,t})\big\|_{\infty}\Big)^{\beta_{1}\land 1}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>stack</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>stack</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∧</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\Big(\max_{t\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\big\|\operatorname{stack}(\mathbf{x}_{3,t},\mathbf{x}_{4,t})-\operatorname{stack}(\mathbf{x}^{\prime}_{3,t},\mathbf{x}^{\prime}_{4,t})\big\|_{\infty}\Big)^{\beta_{1}\land 1},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p5.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p5.6.1" class="ltx_text">using the <math id="A5.SS3.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>-Hölder smoothness of <math id="A5.SS3.p5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{g}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{g}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> and the Lipschitz property
<math id="A5.SS3.p5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\operatorname{softmax}(\mathbf{z})-\operatorname{softmax}(\mathbf{z}^{\prime})\|_{\infty}\leq 2\|\mathbf{z}-\mathbf{z}^{\prime}\|_{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>softmax</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>softmax</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\operatorname{softmax}(\mathbf{z})-\operatorname{softmax}(\mathbf{z}^{\prime})\|_{\infty}\leq 2\|\mathbf{z}-\mathbf{z}^{\prime}\|_{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math> that holds for any real-valued vectors <math id="A5.SS3.p5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐳</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{z}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS3.p5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{z}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{z}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> of the same dimension (see Lemma <a href="#Thmconj231" title="Lemma 31 (Corollary A.7 of []). ‣ Appendix G Technical Lemmas ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">31</span></a>).
Combining this with (<a href="#A5.EGx123" title="E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.3</span></a>), (<a href="#A5.E86" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">86</span></a>), and (<a href="#A5.E87" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">87</span></a>), we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx138" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E92"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E92.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\eqref{tmp_17}\lesssim T^{(\beta_{1}\land 1)(1-\log T)}+\frac{T^{1-\log T}}{\lambda^{2}}\lesssim\frac{1}{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext><mtext><a href="#A5.E70" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">70</span></a></mtext><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mo>≲</mo><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∧</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></msup><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>≲</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\eqref{tmp_17}\lesssim T^{(\beta_{1}\land 1)(1-\log T)}+\frac{T^{1-\log T}}{\lambda^{2}}\lesssim\frac{1}{T}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(92)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p5.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p5.7.1" class="ltx_text">for all sufficiently large <math id="A5.SS3.p5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>.
From (<a href="#A5.E90" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">90</span></a>), (<a href="#A5.E91" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">91</span></a>) and (<a href="#A5.E92" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">92</span></a>), we get the assertion.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS3.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Lemma <a href="#Thmconj227" title="Lemma 27. ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">27</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A5.SS3.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">With</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx139" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.Ex338"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex338.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle P" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>P</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle P</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex338.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\coloneq\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\coloneq\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.Ex339"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex339.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle Q</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex339.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\coloneq\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\big)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\coloneq\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\big),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text">we get</span></p>
<table id="A5.Ex340" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex340.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{P-Q}{P}=\frac{\sum_{i\in([T]\setminus[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])}\exp(a_{i})}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\leq\frac{\exp(\alpha_{+})\cdot 2\log^{2}T}{\exp(\alpha_{-}+c)\cdot T/2}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mi>P</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{P-Q}{P}=\frac{\sum_{i\in([T]\setminus[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])}\exp(a_{i})}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\leq\frac{\exp(\alpha_{+})\cdot 2\log^{2}T}{\exp(\alpha_{-}+c)\cdot T/2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p6.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.3.1" class="ltx_text">and</span></p>
<table id="A5.Ex341" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex341.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|\frac{1}{Q}-\frac{1}{P}\right|\leq\frac{4\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})Q}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>Q</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|\frac{1}{Q}-\frac{1}{P}\right|\leq\frac{4\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})Q}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p6.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.4.1" class="ltx_text">Hence, for every <math id="A5.SS3.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]</annotation></semantics></math>,
we have</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx140" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.Ex342"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex342.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left|\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}-\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp(a_{i})}\right|=\exp\big(a_{s}+c\big)\left|\left(\frac{1}{P}-\frac{1}{Q}\right)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>Q</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left|\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}-\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp(a_{i})}\right|=\exp\big(a_{s}+c\big)\left|\left(\frac{1}{P}-\frac{1}{Q}\right)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.Ex343"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex343.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{4\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})}\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\big)}{Q}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{4\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})}\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\big)}{Q},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p6.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.5.1" class="ltx_text">and summing over <math id="A5.SS3.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx141" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.Ex344"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex344.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\left|\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}-\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp(a_{i})}\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\left|\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}-\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp(a_{i})}\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E93"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E93.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{4\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{4\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(93)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p6.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.6.1" class="ltx_text">On the other hand, for every <math id="A5.SS3.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\notin[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∉</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\notin[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx142" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.Ex345"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex345.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex345.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{\exp(\alpha_{+})}{\exp(\alpha_{-}+c)\cdot T/2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{\exp(\alpha_{+})}{\exp(\alpha_{-}+c)\cdot T/2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p6.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.7.1" class="ltx_text">and hence</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx143" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E94"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E94.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{s\in([T]\setminus[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])}\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\leq\frac{4\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{s\in([T]\setminus[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])}\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\leq\frac{4\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(94)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p6.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.8.1" class="ltx_text">Using (<a href="#A5.E93" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">93</span></a>), (<a href="#A5.E94" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Construction of the Transformer ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">94</span></a>) and <math id="A5.SS3.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mathbf{y}_{s}\|_{\infty}\leq\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mathbf{y}_{s}\|_{\infty}\leq\beta</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx144" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.Ex346"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex346.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\overline{\sum}_{s\in[T]}\Big(\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)\,;\,\mathbf{y}_{s}\Big)-\overline{\sum}_{s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\Big(\exp\big(a_{s}\big)\,;\,\mathbf{y}_{s}\Big)\right\|_{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" rspace="0.170em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" rspace="0.170em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\overline{\sum}_{s\in[T]}\Big(\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)\,;\,\mathbf{y}_{s}\Big)-\overline{\sum}_{s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\Big(\exp\big(a_{s}\big)\,;\,\mathbf{y}_{s}\Big)\right\|_{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.Ex347"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex347.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\|\sum_{s=1}^{T}\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\mathbf{y}_{s}-\sum_{s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp(a_{i})}\mathbf{y}_{s}\right\|_{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\|\sum_{s=1}^{T}\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\mathbf{y}_{s}-\sum_{s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp(a_{i})}\mathbf{y}_{s}\right\|_{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.Ex348"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex348.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\left\|\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\mathbf{y}_{s}-\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp(a_{i})}\mathbf{y}_{s}\right\|_{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\left\|\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\mathbf{y}_{s}-\frac{\exp(a_{s})}{\sum_{i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T]}\exp(a_{i})}\mathbf{y}_{s}\right\|_{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.Ex349"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex349.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{s\in([T]\setminus[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])}\left\|\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\mathbf{y}_{s}\right\|_{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{s\in([T]\setminus[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])}\left\|\frac{\exp\big(a_{s}+c\,\mathbb{I}(s\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\exp\big(a_{i}+c\,\mathbb{I}(i\in[\log^{2}T,T-\log^{2}T])\big)}\mathbf{y}_{s}\right\|_{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.Ex350"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex350.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{8\beta\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{8\beta\log^{2}T}{T\exp(c+\alpha_{-}-\alpha_{+})}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p6.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.9.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
