<p id="A6.SS1.p5.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS1.p5.7.1" class="ltx_text">Combining with (<a href="#A6.E99" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ F.1 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix F Directional Convergence of the Nadaraya–Watson Estimator ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">99</span></a>) and (<a href="#A6.E100" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ F.1 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix F Directional Convergence of the Nadaraya–Watson Estimator ‣ Generalization Bounds for Transformer-Based Next-Token Prediction in a Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">100</span></a>),</span></p>
